    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡμερίδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥμερος</span>) of wine,
